    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mathletics is a fast-paced math game about collecting values to complete objectives. Add, subtract, and strategize your way through handmade math-based puzzles in the campaign, or brave different 'Events' and 'Powerups' as long as you can in 'Endless'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 handmade levels across 5 themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Endless' mode, where you collect numbers until you make a mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups and Events inspired by school supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable game settings so you can decide how you want to play</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mathletics is a fast-paced math game about collecting values to complete objectives. Add, subtract, and strategize your way through handmade math-based puzzles in the campaign, or brave different 'Events' and 'Powerups' as long as you can in 'Endless'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 handmade levels across 5 themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Endless' mode, where you collect numbers until you make a mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups and Events inspired by school supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable game settings so you can decide how you want to play</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Relive a better math class with Mathletics. A fast-paced math game about collecting values to stay within whatever range you set. Add, subtract, and strategize your way through handmade math-based puzzles in the campaign, or brave different 'Events' and 'Powerups' as long as you can in 'Endless'!",
